BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50.00 725.00 Td (The engine is parameterized via BMS_CONFIG_CELL_COUNT supporting 4S, 8S, 12S, and 16S packs without code alterations. In exactly one linear sweep \(< 15 µs\), the engine calculates pack voltage sum, minimum/maximum cell taps, sensor broken-wire detection, and passive balancing activation masks.) Tj ET
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
BT /F2 10 Tf 50.00 695.00 Td (2.2 Adaptive Imbalance Derivation & SoC Knee Expansion) Tj ET
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50.00 680.00 Td (Conventional systems rely on a naive static voltage limit \(e.g., 30 mV\), triggering catastrophic false alarms during 40A acceleration bursts or non-linear OCV knees. Our engine solves this with a closed-form dynamic threshold:) Tj ET
