BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50.00 715.00 Td (Standard Arduino/LiquidCrystal libraries execute lcd.clear\(\) prior to writing text, inducing a 2.0 ms panel blackout and transmitting 80 bytes over I2C \(~32 ms\). Our engine maintains dual in-memory shadow buffers \(front_buffer and back_buffer\), diffing target glyphs against physical DDRAM and clustering contiguous modifications into run-length spans. lcd.clear\(\) is completely banned during runtime.) Tj ET
